        <item>
            <title>1.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 03:46:30 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Schedule editor handles "every hour" times and hour ranges such as 7:00–23:00. They used to be removed when saving.
- Logs follow new output while you're looking at them, and color codes no longer show up as garbage.
- Shows a launchd job's environment variables, such as PATH.
- An old error left in a log no longer marks a job as failed once it has run again.
- Finds Folder Actions that use Automator workflows.
]]></description>
